<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame frame--creed">
    <p class="kicker">Closing stance</p>
    <p>The disciplined version of the proposal is not simply that two infinities disagree. It is that they
      are <strong>temporal antipodes</strong>: each can cast a finite projection into the history between
      them, but neither can occupy the other&rsquo;s boundary event. Their echoes may meet. Their phases may cross.
      Their endpoints do not thereby become one clock.</p>
